WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.337
Alex walks to the car to see the puppy.

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:10.093
Here we are! Hop in. She's on the back seat.

00:00:11.913 --> 00:00:16.705
But there's no puppy in the car! It was a trick.

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:20.056
Alex? Where did you go?

00:00:20.885 --> 00:00:26.093
And Dad is far away. He can't see Alex at all.
